-- a modal dialog on top of another modal dialog
overlays: 2, the upper dialog has the focus: 1
the lower dialog is wider and taller: 1, its buttons are outside the upper dialog: 1
click on the lower dialog's button: overlays 2, lower still open 1 (result 0), focus still on the upper dialog 1
click on the lower dialog's title: overlays 2, focus still on the upper dialog 1
click outside both: overlays 2
click on the upper dialog's Cancel: overlays 1, upper open 0, lower open 1
click on the lower dialog's OK: overlays 0, result 1
-- a popup above a modal dialog still gets its clicks
overlays: 2
click on the popup's OK: overlays 1, popup open 0
click on the dialog's Cancel: overlays 0, dialog open 0
-- a click on the program behind a modal dialog is swallowed
overlays: 1, dialog open 1, focus in the dialog 1
Esc closes it: overlays 0
